{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:18 2026-10-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:18 2026-10-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:18 2026-10-11 HKT</p><p>北大嶼山公路發生交通意外。今日（11日）早上7時03分，兩輛私家車沿北大嶼山公路往機場方向行駛，當駛至近小蠔灣時相撞，其中一輛私家車翻側。救援人員接報指有人被困於車上，隨即趕往現場救援，幸到場後發現無人被困。意外中共4人受傷，警方正調查事故原因。</p><img alt=\"兩車相撞，其中一輛私家車翻側。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/95aa81bf37181e60c7597364a1aa17c3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_08.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d13b344eab74a17ffd5d12ad85f275a3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"兩車相撞，其中一輛私家車翻側。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4435809f08ed186284c1cb2865f82490/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_08_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"另一輛私家車亦損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/81dc6732d8bffbd86e7759ccef727298/2026-10/1_1_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5f2057c6a8c157a730a938b235487220/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0b6457f6b98811b0d5a4c6fdad6eb240/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e5a6aab13bb73439832a2a1e26f6f63d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_06_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f4333eb8f8cf620f79005c8cb5c60f9a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_06_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/234174eb01f97e42235c5aea15e42179/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-11_at_08_02_05.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T00:38:09.183541+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}